# practice/ is a per-file allowlist. Fail closed: everything stays ignored unless listed here.
# The root .gitignore ignores /practice/* so this directory is safe even if this file goes missing.
# Add a line only after clearing the file's licence and checking it for anything personal.
# Unlisted: personal attempts and logs, site-problem solutions, Notion-export notes, and third-party
# material without a licence. See THIRD_PARTY.md.
*
!*/
